DHCP server (dnsmasq)

Usage:
  olr dhcp [command]

Available Commands:
  add         Add a reservation or pool
  disable     Disable the DHCP service
  enable      Enable the DHCP service
  logs        Show dnsmasq log output
  rm          Remove a reservation or pool
  set         Change DHCP configuration
  show        Show DHCP configuration
  status      Show service state, leases and drift

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for dhcp

Global Flags:
      --dry-run         show what would change and exit without applying it
  -o, --output string   output format: text|json (default "text")
      --socket string   olrd control socket (default "/run/olr/olrd.sock")

Use "olr dhcp [command] --help" for more information about a command.
